{
  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative spirit in merging EFF-04 and RES-07, which will enhance our approach to data retention. However, I must emphasize the critical need for integrity and access control (TRU-02) in all aspects of attendance data management. I propose a synthesis that ensures automated alerts (SAF-03) are triggered by significant discrepancies only, allowing for real-time processing (EFF-01) and maintaining overall data integrity. This will help balance efficiency with our security obligations.",
